 "remarks": "Move right into this beautifully updated one-bedroom condominium in Stamford's desirable Cove neighborhood. Freshly painted and filled with natural light, this inviting home features gleaming hardwood floors, crown molding, an updated kitchen with stainless steel appliances, abundant cabinetry, and tile flooring, as well as a renovated bathroom with clean, timeless finishes. The spacious open living area provides flexibility for everyday living, while the separate bedroom offers privacy and comfort. Ideally located just moments from Cove Island Park, Chelsea Piers Connecticut, Cummings Park, beaches, marinas, tennis courts, scenic waterfront walking trails, downtown Stamford, Metro-North, shopping, dining, and I-95, this move-in-ready home offers a wonderful opportunity to enjoy one of Stamford's most sought-after coastal neighborhoods.",
